{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n #宮田愛萌とカラオケなう\n に使っていいよ\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCPX5A46C5PTVW2ZKS4V4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCQW6P6KEPJ1K027X3PTH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 私のまなもが\n 可愛すぎるので\n \n カラオケの写真\n ノーカットで全て載せます\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCRVD5XDNCDWVRKYCG6RQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCSWCRH7QEW7Z1BDP7M1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCTWZ2YG3GQSB7XQ8FH20","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n カラオケでさえも\n 最近ハマっている\n 井口目線の撮影に付き合わせる先輩に\n 少し呆れ気味の宮田さん（笑）\n \n ちなみに\n 一次会のご飯屋さんでも\n 井口目線の撮影に付き合って\n もらったのでお楽しみに〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCVWM9JC13BVVR2X41N33","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCWX0M75S3VY2DH1XD19E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 必死に歌うまなもさん\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCXY7Y1CDZRDW78784CD2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 少し外して笑うまなもさん\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHCZ0XNQ9ZP45200QYE65K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 気を取り直して元気に歌うまなもさん\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHD02PKZRA5VD4VTWMD5XX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHD13TG7XHFMPNTQEWXX7Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHD240E0RERC1V2PGA0PE1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n びっくりまなもさん\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHD33JAXMMY5SQTF7T9CN9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHD43NP7KEXFF06708BFPY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 歌うとき\n 手をぎゅーってして\n 胸に当てるの可愛すぎ🥰\n \n \n 以上\n 体感型宮田愛萌とカラオケ大会🎤\n \n でした〜\n \n \n 最近まなもに\n 私って有能カメラマンじゃない？ね？\n って無理やりブログを見せて\n 有能と言ってもらってます（笑）\n \n なんて先輩だ😣\n \n \n photo by 有能カメラマン井口眞緒"}],"source":"archive"}